{"schemaVersion":1,"id":311,"sections":[{"id":"706001-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[20150],"start":0,"count":39},{"id":"706001-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[20151],"start":39,"count":32},{"id":"706002-PROLOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战前","scripts":[20152],"start":71,"count":29},{"id":"706002-EPILOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战后","scripts":[20153],"start":100,"count":29}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"706001-PROLOGUE:20150:0","scriptId":20150,"text":"故事回溯到“突袭行动”开始不久之后……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"706001-PROLOGUE:20150:2","scriptId":20150,"text":"持续的拉锯战还在进行中，不过这次我们所执行的任务和“突袭行动”并无关系——","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706001-PROLOGUE:20150:3","scriptId":20150,"text":"“艾丽莎说过旅行者短期内不会再有激进的行动，不过她们留下的摊子也挺麻烦的。”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"706001-PROLOGUE:20150:4","scriptId":20150,"text":"由于战车兽的进化，高智能的机械战车兽越来越多（俗称第二世代战车兽），始作俑者兰布达也并没预想到会发生这样的情况。","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"706001-PROLOGUE:20150:5","scriptId":20150,"text":"特别是由于“突袭行动”的展开，大部分特勤局的钢舞姬和部分死水钢舞姬都已经投入到了各地的暴动镇压之中。","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"706001-PROLOGUE:20150:6","scriptId":20150,"text":"结果就是现在真正能处理事情的钢舞姬部队是少之又少，即便是死水也没有余力。","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"706001-PROLOGUE:20150:7","scriptId":20150,"text":"而我们小队是在“突袭行动”中率先镇压了分配区域之后才空下来接了这次任务。","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706001-PROLOGUE:20150:8","scriptId":20150,"text":"“残留的第一世代战车兽还剩不少，第二世代的战车兽也已经开始有疯涨的趋势了……外加那些被闲置的软泥和义体……”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706001-PROLOGUE:20150:9","scriptId":20150,"text":"“真不知道以后会怎么样呢……”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":740,"right":584,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706001-PROLOGUE:20150:10","scriptId":20150,"text":"“简直是混乱不堪……不过么有一点好处就是至少不用考虑饭碗的问题，最近的委托也越来越多，但是有空接任务的队伍反而很少。”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":740,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":592,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706001-PROLOGUE:20150:11","scriptId":20150,"text":"“是啊，还是长官指挥得当，动作迅速，让我们用了很短的时间就镇压了分配区域。”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":592,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706001-PROLOGUE:20150:12","scriptId":20150,"text":"“不过那也是因为我们小队晋升成连队了，队伍战斗力一下子涨了不少。”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":592,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":746,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706001-PROLOGUE:20150:13","scriptId":20150,"text":"“是啊……确实涨了不少……”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":746,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"706001-PROLOGUE:20150:14","scriptId":20150,"text":"佐伊扫了一眼，正在开车的新队员——芙琳·勒布。","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":746,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":736,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706001-PROLOGUE:20150:15","scriptId":20150,"text":"“佐伊你也要大方点啦～虽然我也有点不太喜欢这样，但长官如今这种职位，想不受欢迎也困难啊～”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":746,"right":736,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":744,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706001-PROLOGUE:20150:16","scriptId":20150,"text":"“哪有！？我可什么都没说。”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":744,"right":736,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":738,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706001-PROLOGUE:20150:17","scriptId":20150,"text":"“都写在脸上了～”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":744,"right":738,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"706001-PROLOGUE:20150:18","scriptId":20150,"text":"因为之前成功解除了死水的危机，得到了嘉奖的我获得了装甲连队的指挥权，因此现在有三个小队的钢舞姬在我的管辖之下。","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":744,"right":738,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"706001-PROLOGUE:20150:19","scriptId":20150,"text":"目前除了佐伊和佩妮还有尤拉在我车上以外，维卡和奈特莉都各自带着新加入的队员在另外一辆运输车辆上……","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":744,"right":738,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":897,"speaker":"芙琳·勒布","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706001-PROLOGUE:20150:20","scriptId":20150,"text":"“没想到长官在死水已经那么有影响力了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":897,"right":738,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"706001-PROLOGUE:20150:21","scriptId":20150,"text":"这时候芙琳也加入了我们的谈话。","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":897,"right":738,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706001-PROLOGUE:20150:22","scriptId":20150,"text":"“还好吧，若不是蕾贝卡在台后穿针引线维多利亚团长应该是不会答应的吧……”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":897,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706001-PROLOGUE:20150:23","scriptId":20150,"text":"（有好有坏，多了人手，但是管她们温饱也是需要考虑的事情……）","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":897,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"706001-PROLOGUE:20150:24","scriptId":20150,"text":"因为扩编的关系，小队所需要的运转资金提高了很多。","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":897,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"706001-PROLOGUE:20150:25","scriptId":20150,"text":"但也因此我们才有幸能独自处理来自拜科努尔航天研究所的任务。","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":897,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"706001-PROLOGUE:20150:26","scriptId":20150,"text":"要知道这个任务原本是要求三小队以上的钢舞姬一起协同完成的。","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":897,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":897,"speaker":"芙琳·勒布","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706001-PROLOGUE:20150:27","scriptId":20150,"text":"“那个，马上就要到了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":897,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"706001-PROLOGUE:20150:28","scriptId":20150,"text":"手握方向盘的芙琳提醒道。","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":897,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"706001-PROLOGUE:20150:29","scriptId":20150,"text":"随着一阵阵的颠簸，地平线的尽头慢慢开始露出火箭发射架的尖端。","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":897,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706001-PROLOGUE:20150:30","scriptId":20150,"text":"“哦！已经可以看到了嘛！？”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":897,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"706001-PROLOGUE:20150:31","scriptId":20150,"text":"之前都是在照片或者报纸上看到拜科努尔航天研究所的，今天第一次来到发射场还是有点小激动的。","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":897,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":897,"speaker":"芙琳·勒布","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706001-PROLOGUE:20150:32","scriptId":20150,"text":"“长官不要太兴奋，当心咬到舌头。”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":897,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706001-PROLOGUE:20150:33","scriptId":20150,"text":"“啊……我会注意的～谢谢，芙琳了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":897,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":897,"speaker":"芙琳·勒布","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706001-PROLOGUE:20150:34","scriptId":20150,"text":"“分内之事～”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":897,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706001-PROLOGUE:20150:35","scriptId":20150,"text":"“看样子也就还有十多分钟的路程。”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":897,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":746,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706001-PROLOGUE:20150:36","scriptId":20150,"text":"“长官对芙琳就那么客气……”（小声）","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":746,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706001-PROLOGUE:20150:37","scriptId":20150,"text":"“这里道路比较荒凉，可以很容易就确认有没有战车兽的身影，不过还是要注意观察四周。”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":584,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"706001-PROLOGUE:20150:38","scriptId":20150,"text":"看到注意力不集中的姐姐，佩妮立刻提醒她现在的状况。","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":584,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":746,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706001-PROLOGUE:20150:39","scriptId":20150,"text":"“好了，知道了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":746,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"706001-EPILOGUE:20151:1","scriptId":20151,"text":"行驶过一小段砂石铺设的简易道路之后，我们终于来到了拜科努尔航天研究所的正门。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":746,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706001-EPILOGUE:20151:2","scriptId":20151,"text":"“哇……好大啊～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":740,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706001-EPILOGUE:20151:3","scriptId":20151,"text":"“恩，不得不说这里大得有点过分啊……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":740,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":735,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706001-EPILOGUE:20151:4","scriptId":20151,"text":"“怪不得说要三个小队以上……光是保护研究所的发射中心就至少要三个小队吧……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":735,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706001-EPILOGUE:20151:5","scriptId":20151,"text":"“是的，任务主要也是在发射的时候保护好发射中心。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":735,"right":584,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":897,"speaker":"芙琳·勒布","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706001-EPILOGUE:20151:6","scriptId":20151,"text":"“真是个艰巨的任务啊……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":897,"right":584,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706001-EPILOGUE:20151:7","scriptId":20151,"text":"“顺便可以参观一下～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":897,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":746,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706001-EPILOGUE:20151:8","scriptId":20151,"text":"“长官又公私不分了……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":746,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706001-EPILOGUE:20151:9","scriptId":20151,"text":"“呵呵～研究所内部结构必须要了解吧，万一发生什么不认路可就难办了啊～所以这参观是非常必要的～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":746,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":746,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706001-EPILOGUE:20151:10","scriptId":20151,"text":"“找借口本事天下第一。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":746,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706001-EPILOGUE:20151:11","scriptId":20151,"text":"“谢谢夸奖～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":746,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"706001-EPILOGUE:20151:12","scriptId":20151,"text":"于是我就准备进到研究所内部，谁知——","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":746,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706001-EPILOGUE:20151:13","scriptId":20151,"text":"“呃……因为可能涉及机密，所以只能进去两个人……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":746,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"706001-EPILOGUE:20151:14","scriptId":20151,"text":"说完我晃了晃工作人员给我的两张票子……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":746,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":747,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706001-EPILOGUE:20151:15","scriptId":20151,"text":"“诶！？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":747,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706001-EPILOGUE:20151:16","scriptId":20151,"text":"“反正我肯定是要进去的，所以剩下的那个名额你们谁想去？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":747,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"706001-EPILOGUE:20151:17","scriptId":20151,"text":"我刚说完，就有两个人跳了起来。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":747,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706001-EPILOGUE:20151:18","scriptId":20151,"text":"“我我我！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":740,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":728,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706001-EPILOGUE:20151:19","scriptId":20151,"text":"“我我我！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":740,"right":728,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":589,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706001-EPILOGUE:20151:20","scriptId":20151,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":589,"right":728,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706001-EPILOGUE:20151:21","scriptId":20151,"text":"“算了，公平起见，还是抽签吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":4,"right":728,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":582,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706001-EPILOGUE:20151:22","scriptId":20151,"text":"“不公平啊～还得算上我们呢～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":4,"right":582,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"706001-EPILOGUE:20151:23","scriptId":20151,"text":"另一个声音从我身后传了过来，是奈特莉，显然她也听到了我们的对话。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":4,"right":582,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":582,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706001-EPILOGUE:20151:24","scriptId":20151,"text":"“长官可不能私心啊～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":4,"right":582,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"706001-EPILOGUE:20151:25","scriptId":20151,"text":"剩下的几名队员也到了，远处能看到维卡正在和守卫的士兵处理停车的问题。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":4,"right":582,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706001-EPILOGUE:20151:26","scriptId":20151,"text":"“这时候如果带着波西娅就好了，她肯定有办法带我们所有人进去。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":4,"right":582,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":728,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706001-EPILOGUE:20151:27","scriptId":20151,"text":"“是啊……可惜姐姐不在这里。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":4,"right":728,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"706001-EPILOGUE:20151:28","scriptId":20151,"text":"于是最后只能抽签决定剩下那个名额的归属问题。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":4,"right":728,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"706001-EPILOGUE:20151:29","scriptId":20151,"text":"最终——","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":4,"right":728,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706001-EPILOGUE:20151:30","scriptId":20151,"text":"“好了，那么走吧，芙琳。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":4,"right":728,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":897,"speaker":"芙琳·勒布","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706001-EPILOGUE:20151:31","scriptId":20151,"text":"“是！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"706001-EPILOGUE:20151:32","scriptId":20151,"text":"芙琳抽到了那唯一的名额……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"706002-PROLOGUE:20152:1","scriptId":20152,"text":"经过一番简易的检查，确保我们没有带什么违禁物品之后，研究人员带我们进入了研究所的内部。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"706002-PROLOGUE:20152:2","scriptId":20152,"text":"可能因为马上要进行什么测试的关系，很多工作人员都在奔东走西，根本没什么人来管我们……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706002-PROLOGUE:20152:3","scriptId":20152,"text":"“进来的过程挺严格，到了里面发现也不过如此嘛……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":897,"speaker":"芙琳·勒布","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706002-PROLOGUE:20152:4","scriptId":20152,"text":"“是啊……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"706002-PROLOGUE:20152:5","scriptId":20152,"text":"杂乱堆放的文件箱，还有各种电线和电子器械，根本就是一团糟。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"706002-PROLOGUE:20152:6","scriptId":20152,"text":"我的兴致一下子跌到了谷底。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":897,"speaker":"芙琳·勒布","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706002-PROLOGUE:20152:7","scriptId":20152,"text":"“不过我们的目的是来确认建筑内部的结构吧，所以还是认真工作吧～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706002-PROLOGUE:20152:8","scriptId":20152,"text":"“也对，不过科研环境还真都是差别不大啊，波西娅的研究室也挺乱的……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":897,"speaker":"芙琳·勒布","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706002-PROLOGUE:20152:9","scriptId":20152,"text":"“那我们就不要打扰他们了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706002-PROLOGUE:20152:10","scriptId":20152,"text":"“恩，走吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"706002-PROLOGUE:20152:11","scriptId":20152,"text":"我们快速穿过了有许多研究员正在忙碌的监控大厅，来到了走道上。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"706002-PROLOGUE:20152:12","scriptId":20152,"text":"走道上挂着一幅很大的地图，看来这就是研究室内部的结构图了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706002-PROLOGUE:20152:13","scriptId":20152,"text":"“有这东西就好办了，很多路都不用走了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"706002-PROLOGUE:20152:14","scriptId":20152,"text":"突然，无线电中传来了沙沙声。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706002-PROLOGUE:20152:15","scriptId":20152,"text":"“嗯？好像是佐伊她们。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":897,"speaker":"芙琳·勒布","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706002-PROLOGUE:20152:16","scriptId":20152,"text":"“我也收到了，不过好像有干扰听不清的样子。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"706002-PROLOGUE:20152:17","scriptId":20152,"text":"就在这时，整个研究所的大厅也开始响起了警报。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":897,"speaker":"芙琳·勒布","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706002-PROLOGUE:20152:18","scriptId":20152,"text":"“肯定是战车兽的警报。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"706002-PROLOGUE:20152:19","scriptId":20152,"text":"芙琳一脸严肃地向我报告到。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706002-PROLOGUE:20152:20","scriptId":20152,"text":"“我的天……那么快就有活干了？我们先回到外面吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"706002-PROLOGUE:20152:21","scriptId":20152,"text":"“哐当”我们所在的走廊闸门关了起来。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706002-PROLOGUE:20152:22","scriptId":20152,"text":"“！？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":897,"speaker":"芙琳·勒布","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706002-PROLOGUE:20152:23","scriptId":20152,"text":"“长官！？我们被关在里面了！？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"706002-PROLOGUE:20152:24","scriptId":20152,"text":"芙琳显得有点慌张，确实这是之前没有想到过的情况。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706002-PROLOGUE:20152:25","scriptId":20152,"text":"“不要慌张，我想这应该是研究所的自卫系统。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"706002-PROLOGUE:20152:26","scriptId":20152,"text":"我抬头仔细看了看研究所的地图，发现上面有牌小字。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706002-PROLOGUE:20152:27","scriptId":20152,"text":"“遇到紧急情况，请根据指示牌的指示行动……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":897,"speaker":"芙琳·勒布","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706002-PROLOGUE:20152:28","scriptId":20152,"text":"“哦！？果然还是长官厉害，在这种场合还是那么镇定。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"706002-PROLOGUE:20152:29","scriptId":20152,"text":"芙琳显然也看到了那排字，于是我们开始寻找指示牌……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-104.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"706002-EPILOGUE:20153:1","scriptId":20153,"text":"另一边，正在攻击航天研究所的战车兽方面。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":4,"right":897,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":910,"speaker":"剃刀","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"706002-EPILOGUE:20153:2","scriptId":20153,"text":"“军刀，结果汇报。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":910,"right":897,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":909,"speaker":"军刀","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"706002-EPILOGUE:20153:3","scriptId":20153,"text":"“交战中，正门敌人，钢舞姬大量。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":910,"right":909,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":910,"speaker":"剃刀","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"706002-EPILOGUE:20153:4","scriptId":20153,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":910,"right":909,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":910,"speaker":"剃刀","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"706002-EPILOGUE:20153:5","scriptId":20153,"text":"“撤退，视野开阔，作战续行，不利。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":910,"right":909,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":909,"speaker":"军刀","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"706002-EPILOGUE:20153:6","scriptId":20153,"text":"“接收。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":910,"right":909,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"706002-EPILOGUE:20153:8","scriptId":20153,"text":"不消片刻，战车兽的部队都退出了作战区域。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706002-EPILOGUE:20153:9","scriptId":20153,"text":"“呼……很轻松嘛。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":740,"right":null,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":591,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706002-EPILOGUE:20153:10","scriptId":20153,"text":"“是第二世代的战车兽，不好办啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":740,"right":591,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706002-EPILOGUE:20153:11","scriptId":20153,"text":"“战车兽不是已经撤退了嘛？有什么好担心的。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":740,"right":591,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":572,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706002-EPILOGUE:20153:12","scriptId":20153,"text":"“就是因为撤退了才麻烦啊，这些家伙很聪明，知道正面和我们硬打是没有胜算的。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":740,"right":572,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":728,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706002-EPILOGUE:20153:13","scriptId":20153,"text":"“不过我们这边战斗力有优势，这些‘聪明’的家伙应该也没有办法和我们抗衡吧～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":728,"right":572,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":591,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706002-EPILOGUE:20153:14","scriptId":20153,"text":"“是啊，但是不能保证它们不会再来。特别这次是狐狸型的比较狡猾，不好对付。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":728,"right":591,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":596,"speaker":"维卡","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706002-EPILOGUE:20153:15","scriptId":20153,"text":"“偷袭。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":596,"right":591,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":916,"speaker":"梅丽雅·马尔斯","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706002-EPILOGUE:20153:16","scriptId":20153,"text":"“恩，维卡前辈说得很对！偷袭是它们的惯用伎俩。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":596,"right":916,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":596,"speaker":"维卡","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706002-EPILOGUE:20153:17","scriptId":20153,"text":"“呜……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":596,"right":916,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"706002-EPILOGUE:20153:18","scriptId":20153,"text":"看来维卡还是没适应自己的新后辈。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":596,"right":916,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"706002-EPILOGUE:20153:19","scriptId":20153,"text":"梅丽雅一脸笑嘻嘻的站在维卡旁边。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":596,"right":916,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":928,"speaker":"莉迪亚·鲍里索夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706002-EPILOGUE:20153:20","scriptId":20153,"text":"“哼，长官还没出来吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":596,"right":928,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"706002-EPILOGUE:20153:21","scriptId":20153,"text":"一个微弱的声音传了过来，是莉迪亚。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":596,"right":928,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706002-EPILOGUE:20153:22","scriptId":20153,"text":"“之前警报响起的时候有尝试着联系过，但是不知道为什么有干扰。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":584,"right":928,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":572,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706002-EPILOGUE:20153:23","scriptId":20153,"text":"“发生那么大的动静，长官肯定会出来看的吧。我们等等就好了～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":584,"right":572,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706002-EPILOGUE:20153:24","scriptId":20153,"text":"“恩，同意，大家暂时先保持队形。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":584,"right":572,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":940,"speaker":"伊诺·赞佩里尼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706002-EPILOGUE:20153:25","scriptId":20153,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":584,"right":940,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706002-EPILOGUE:20153:26","scriptId":20153,"text":"“伊诺有什么问题吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":584,"right":940,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"706002-EPILOGUE:20153:27","scriptId":20153,"text":"看到其他人都动起来了，只有伊诺还盯着研究所的方向，佩妮感到有点奇怪。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":584,"right":940,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":940,"speaker":"伊诺·赞佩里尼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706002-EPILOGUE:20153:28","scriptId":20153,"text":"“不，没什么。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":584,"right":940,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"706002-EPILOGUE:20153:29","scriptId":20153,"text":"伊诺摇了摇头，也开始往维卡的方向移动。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":584,"right":940,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"706002-EPILOGUE:20153:30","scriptId":20153,"text":"“恩，希望在长官回来之前，别再发生什么意外情况就好了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-17.webp","left":584,"right":940,"section":3,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
